s8-5-p24 : Block
s8-5-p24 = prose (cons "Records combine field encodings at specified offsets with alignment and padding rules. Sums additionally encode the tag and its relation to the active payload. Recursive structures use addresses and allocation metadata rather than an infinite flat record. ABI layouts include all observable details: calling convention, alignment, padding, tag placement, register classes, return convention, and the applicable object and exception ABI." nil)
